{title: 09 Alabemos al Señor}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{lyricist: Ursula Schlenker, 1949 (1930-; Vers. esp.: Anónimo}
{composer: Alfred Stier, 1949 (1880-1967); Arr.: Melvin West, 1984 (1930- )}

{sov}
1. [Bb]Alabemos [Eb]al Se[Bb]ñor;
demos gloria [Eb]al [F7]Se[Bb]ñor.
[Eb]Aleluya, a[Bb]mén,
[Eb]aleluya, a[Bb]mén.
{eov}

{sov}
2. [Bb]Prediquemos [Eb]de su [Bb]amor;
anunciemos [Eb]su [F7]per[Bb]dón.
[Eb]Aleluya, a[Bb]mén,
[Eb]aleluya, a[Bb]mén.
{eov}
